  "description": "Journeyer Flat Bar Deore 700c is more than capable on all your local gravel routes, with a flat-bar setup that grants you lots of leverage on rough roads or with heavy loads. The all-new aluminum frame and Fantail aluminum fork focus on rider comfort and versatility. Rack and fender mounts, plus our signature Three-Pack and accessory mounts, mean that Journeyer is ready for gravel rides, bikepacking, or adding a little fun to your errand run.\n\n700c wheels and 38 mm tires roll efficiently on a wide range of surfaces and offer traction in loose corners. Shimano’s time-tested Deore components ensure a smooth, reliable ride. Journeyer is a flat bar gravel bike that can go a long way.",
